<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Heavy to supply power generators in China.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Heavy to supply power generators in China.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Heavy Industries said on Wednesday that it had won an order to supply two power generators for a coal-burning power plant to be built in Shanxi province in China.</p>
<p>The equipment would be purchased with Japanese government loans, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Corp and Mitsubishi Heavy Industries had previously won a bid to supply $180 million worth of power generating equipment for the first-phase construction of two 350-megawatt generating units in the northern China province of Hebei.</p>
</text>
